The strongest usable family is the paper’s Section 4.3 reduction from Numerical 3-Dimensional Matching to Load-and-Gas-Capacitated VRP on a star. It avoids the triage’s main pitfall: arbitrary planted routes can be recognizable, whereas here every client is generated exchangeably and the hidden matching is one perfect matching among many exact-sum triples. The hard parameters stay in the paper’s para-NP-hard regime: treewidth 1, one depot, unit demands, and load 3 are fixed, while the number of clients, vehicles, gas bound, and total bound grow.
